  "triageBadgeReminderSoon": "Reminder soon",
  "@triageBadgeReminderSoon": {
    "description": "The badge on a Home card because a reminder the person set for themselves is due within the next day. It is not an alert, an alarm or a warning — it reports the person's own scheduled reminder. Stored sentence case and uppercased at render by eyebrowCase(), so do not supply it in capitals."
